      "alt": "TQMa57xx Embedded Cortex®-A15 module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on AM57xx for applications with real-time requirements</h1>\n<p>The TQMa57xx is an embedded Cortex®-A15 module based on AM57xx, designed for applications with real-time requirements. It offers high-speed communication capabilities, including up to 2xGbE, 4x real-time Ethernet, 2x PCIe, and USB 3.0 support. With low power consumption (typ. 4W) and integrated 2x Cortex M4, it delivers reliable performance. This module also features IEEE 1588 hardware support and security functions, making it ideal for applications in networking, industrial automation, and controls with demands for fast and secure data processing.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:18:13 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
